t submittal of an actual Brownfields Property Application and a finding tha=
t the applicant and the property are eligible for the Brownfields Program.

You can find additional information on our website at www.ncbrownfields.gov=
<http://www.ncbrownfields.gov>.

Thanks,
Sharon

